flowchart TD
  In[Request] --> Verify[Verify and load scoped context]
  Verify --> Kind{Request type}
  Kind -->|User command| Router[Intent router: rules]
  Router -->|Simple greeting| Save[Persist result]
  Router -->|Other requests| Tier2[Tier 2: conversational agent]
  Tier2 -->|Needs evidence or action| Tools2[Tools and phone action bridge]
  Tools2 --> Tier2
  Tier2 -->|Final answer| Save
  Kind -->|Activity telemetry| Gate[Context gate: rules]
  Gate -->|Ambiguous evidence| Tier1[Tier 1: context reasoner]
  Tier1 --> Tools1[Context tools]
  Tools1 --> Tier1
  Tier1 --> Reducer[Session reducer]
  Gate -->|Sufficient evidence| Reducer
  Reducer --> Semantic[Semantic context]
  Semantic --> Save
  Save --> End[Response and stored records]
